{"id":"tarea","lemma":"tarea","pos":"noun","rank":1392,"glosses":["task","homework"],"ipa":"/taˈɾea/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tareas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tarea.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es una tarea simple.","en":"It's a simple job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443316"},{"text":"¿Has hecho todas tus tareas?","en":"Have you done all your homework?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/615985"},{"text":"Es una simple tarea.","en":"It's a simple job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443317"},{"text":"Nos repartimos las tareas del hogar.","en":"We share the housework.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459965"},{"text":"Haz tu tarea ya.","en":"Do your homework now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453582"}]}